{"id":"fa2f4519ad363e1d","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-conjugate-exponents.md","title":"Conjugate Exponents","display":"df-conjugate-exponents — Conjugate Exponents","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-conjugate-exponents","aliases":["58-df-conjugate-exponents","Conjugate Exponents"],"display":"df-conjugate-exponents — Conjugate Exponents","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-conjugate-exponents"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-conjugate-exponents</span><span>Conjugate Exponents</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-conjugate-exponents — Conjugate Exponents"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\\in[1,\\infty]\">\\(p,q\\in[1,\\infty]\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConjugateExponents}_S\\subseteq[1,\\infty]^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ConjugateExponents}_S\\subseteq[1,\\infty]^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty^{-1}=0\">\\(\\infty^{-1}=0\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conjugate\\text{-}exponents} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConjugateExponents}_S(p,q)\\leftrightarrow p^{-1}+q^{-1}=1\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conjugate\\text{-}exponents} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConjugateExponents}_S(p,q)\\leftrightarrow p^{-1}+q^{-1}=1\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Conjugate exponents: Hölder duality; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p\">\\(L^p\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^q\">\\(L^q\\)</span> are dual spaces for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p \\in (1,\\infty)\">\\(p \\in (1,\\infty)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=2\">\\(p=2\\)</span>: conjugate is 2; Hilbert space self-duality</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=1\">\\(p=1\\)</span>: the conjugate exponent is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span>; under the standard hypotheses identifying <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(L^1)^*\">\\((L^1)^*\\)</span>, the identification with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^\\infty\">\\(L^\\infty\\)</span> is isometric.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=\\infty\">\\(p=\\infty\\)</span>: conjugate is 1; degenerate case; no Hölder gain</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Real and Complex Analysis</li>\n<li>Folland, Real Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"p,q\\in[1,\\infty]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConjugateExponents}_S\\subseteq[1,\\infty]^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty^{-1}=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conjugate\\text{-}exponents} \\vdash \\mathrm{ConjugateExponents}_S(p,q)\\leftrightarrow p^{-1}+q^{-1}=1","display":true},{"tex":"L^p","display":false},{"tex":"L^q","display":false},{"tex":"p \\in (1,\\infty)","display":false},{"tex":"p=2","display":false},{"tex":"p=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"(L^1)^*","display":false},{"tex":"L^\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"p=\\infty","display":false}],"bytes":1012,"backlinks":[{"id":"dbdc45afd5f344e4","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-349","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-conjugate-exponents.md|58-df-conjugate-exponents]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":[]}